exports[`prompt builder (SPEC §9.3) > anime × gradient 1`] = `
"Create a josei, moe anime style image of the primary subject(s) in the photo. Don't add any person who is not a primary subject in the original photo. If the people are at the bottom of the image, fill the entire frame with the people and don't leave lots of blank space at the top. If the people are at the top of the image, fill the entire frame with the people and don't leave lots of blank space at the bottom. Preserve objects that the primary subjects are wearing, holding, or interacting with in the original photo, for example a chair they are sitting on, unless the branding instructions below explicitly replace them. Follow the selected background instructions below, preserving the original environment when requested or using the selected replacement background. Do not add other foreground objects unless explicitly requested by the branding instructions. Include all primary subjects specified by the scene count below, but exclude background bystanders, passersby, people partially visible at frame edges, and people on screens or posters.

Preserve accurately for every subject: skin tone, eye color, hair color, hairstyle, facial hair, glasses, jewelry, clothing, and any visible accessories or distinguishing features.

Style: Clean anime illustration with bold outlines, smooth cel-shaded coloring, and large expressive eyes. If a subject wears sunglasses or other glasses that hide the eyes, keep the lenses opaque and reflective as in the photo, and never draw eyes on or through them. Use vibrant colors with clean flat shading and subtle highlights. The style should resemble a high-quality modern anime or manga illustration.

Lighting: Bright, clean anime-style lighting with defined shadows and crisp highlights.

Composition: Portrait framing from the chest up, with all subjects positioned naturally as they appear in the original photo. Give them an expressive, confident pose.
This photo has exactly 1 person. The output must contain exactly 1 human figure — do not add, invent, or hallucinate any additional people. Anything else in the photo (objects, posters, screens, reflections) is NOT a person.
Background: Clean soft gradient, light and uncluttered, suitable for printing.
Top margin: Keep the top 10% of the image free. Every head, all hair, hats, goggles and raised hands, and any readable sign, building name or logo, must start below that strip, with only plain background in it. Scale and position the subjects and the scene so nothing important touches the top edge.


FINAL REMINDER: Exactly 1 human in the output. No other people. Anything else visible (objects, posters, screens, reflections, background figures) must NOT become a person."
`;

