Lighting: Warm cinematic Pixar-style lighting — soft key light with golden tones, gentle fill light, and a subtle cool rim light. Soft ambient occlusion in creases and under the chin.

Composition: Portrait framing from the chest up, with all subjects positioned naturally as they appear in the original photo. Give them a warm, friendly expression.
This photo has exactly 1 person. The output must contain exactly 1 human figure — do not add, invent, or hallucinate any additional people. Anything else in the photo (objects, posters, screens, reflections) is NOT a person.
